## 14. Testing

Some basic test cases were considered while developing the program.

| Test Case                | Expected Result                         |
| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------- |
| Add a valid expense      | Expense should be added                 |
| View with no expenses    | "No expenses found" should be displayed |
| Calculate total          | Correct total should be displayed       |
