## 15. Challenges Faced

One of the main challenges was keeping the expense name, amount, and category connected correctly while using separate lists.

Another issue was handling user input because the program uses both `nextInt()` and `nextLine()`. The input buffer needs to be handled properly after reading numbers.

Creating the category summary was also a useful part of the project because it required using a `HashMap` and adding amounts for the same category.

